This directory will contain the Next.js App Router pages and layouts.

Structure (to be created when Next.js is initialized):

  app/
    layout.tsx          — root layout (fonts, global styles, auth shell)
    page.tsx            — root redirect (→ /hearth or /login)
    (auth)/
      login/page.tsx
      signup/page.tsx
    (app)/
      layout.tsx        — authenticated layout (navigation, GameShell)
      hearth/page.tsx
      root/page.tsx
      satchel/page.tsx
      chronicle/page.tsx
      onboard/page.tsx
      settings/page.tsx

Do not create this structure until the Next.js skeleton is initialized by Susmita.
